Six Mile Creek, located between Tawanton and Coroy. They stopped again in Brisbane to purchase milk and cat food, arriving back at their property in Lowwood at around 10pm. Valmer Beck put their dirty clothes in the washing machine and started to cry. Barry Watts comforted her, telling her not to be upset and complimenting her for doing a great job and being a good wife. They then had sex for the first time in a long while. Although Valmer Beck and Barry Watts were confident they hadn't been seen during the attack on Sean Kingey, they went to great lengths to avoid detection. Beck cut her husband's sun bleached hair short and dyed it brown, then bleached her own hair. They changed their

